      en: ["The Qannoubine Valley is 15 km (9.3 mi) long.", "The maximum depth is 1,000 m (3,280 ft).", "It contains over 30 rock-cut monasteries and hermitages.", "The valley is part of the UNESCO World Heritage Site Qadisha Valley (inscribed 1998).", "The Nahr Qadisha river flows for 35 km (22 mi).", "Average elevation of the valley floor is 1,200 m (3,940 ft)."],
